{"ref":"BDB, קָדַד","hw":"קָדַד","html":"† <big><big>[<span dir=\"rtl\">קָדַד</span>]</big></big>  <strong>vb. bow down (</strong>Assyrian (including TelAm.) <em>ḳadâdu</em>, <em>bow down</em><strong>)</strong>;—<br><strong>Qal</strong>  Impf. 3 ms. <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּקֹּד</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:26\" href=\"/Genesis.24.26\">Gn 24:26</a> +, etc.;—usually + <span dir=\"rtl\">וַיִּשְׁתַּחוּ</span> etc.; in worship of <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:26\" href=\"/Genesis.24.26\">Gn 24:26</a>, <a data-ref=\"Genesis 24:48\" href=\"/Genesis.24.48\">48</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 4:31\" href=\"/Exodus.4.31\">Ex 4:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 12:27\" href=\"/Exodus.12.27\">12:27</a>; <a data-ref=\"Exodus 34:8\" href=\"/Exodus.34.8\">34:8</a>; <a data-ref=\"Numbers 22:31\" href=\"/Numbers.22.31\">Nu 22:31</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 20:18\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.20.18\">2 Ch 20:18</a>; <a data-ref=\"II Chronicles 29:30\" href=\"/II_Chronicles.29.30\">29:30</a>; <a data-ref=\"Nehemiah 8:6\" href=\"/Nehemiah.8.6\">Ne 8:6</a>; homage to man of rank <a data-ref=\"Genesis 43:28\" href=\"/Genesis.43.28\">Gn 43:28</a>, king <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:9\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.9\">1 S 24:9</a> (Gi v <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 24:8\" href=\"/I_Samuel.24.8\">8</a>), <a data-ref=\"I Samuel 28:14\" href=\"/I_Samuel.28.14\">28:14</a>; <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:16\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.16\">1 K 1:16</a>, <a data-ref=\"I Kings 1:31\" href=\"/I_Kings.1.31\">31</a>; to <span dir=\"rtl\">י׳</span> + king <a data-ref=\"I Chronicles 29:20\" href=\"/I_Chronicles.29.20\">1 Ch 29:20</a>.","next":"BDB, קדד","prev":"BDB, קֳבָתָהּ"}